        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e3ad6f42-6dcb-5782-a0e5-448326accb02",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Heder, Rob Schneider, David Spade, Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Cheryl Hines, Gary Cole, Roy Disney\n- Films and Series: Napoleon Dynamite, The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, Walt Before Mickey, Monster House, Surf's Up, Napoleon Dynamite animated series, Christmas Eve\n- Companies: Revolution Studios, Happy Madison Productions, Columbia Pictures\n- Roles: actor, producer, voice actor\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Heder was born on October 26, 1977, and he is an American actor and producer.\n- Jon Heder made his feature film debut in 2004 by playing the title character in the comedy film Napoleon Dynamite.\n- Jon Heder later acted in The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, and Walt Before Mickey, in which he played Roy Disney.\n- Jon Heder also provided voice acting for the animated films Monster House and Surf's Up and for the Napoleon Dynamite animated series.\n- The Benchwarmers stars Rob Schneider, David Spade, and Jon Heder.\n- The Benchwarmers was produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and was distributed by Columbia Pictures.\n- The 2015 film Christmas Eve features an ensemble cast led by Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Jon Heder, Cheryl Hines, and Gary Cole.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "0c607024-4cfd-555b-aa76-f602b7877609",
        "text": "Page: Jon Heder. Sentence: Jonathan Joseph \"Jon\" Heder ( ) (born October 26, 1977) is an American actor and producer.\nPage: Jon Heder. Sentence: His feature film debut came in 2004 as the title character of the comedy film \"Napoleon Dynamite\".\nPage: Jon Heder. Sentence: He has also acted in the films \"The Benchwarmers\", \"School for Scoundrels\", \"Blades of Glory\", \"Mama's Boy\", \"When in Rome\", and \"Walt Before Mickey\" as Roy Disney, and provided voice talents in the animated films \"Monster House\" and \"Surf's Up\", as well as the \"Napoleon Dynamite\" animated series.\nPage: The Benchwarmers. Sentence: It stars Rob Schneider, David Spade, and Jon Heder.\nPage: The Benchwarmers. Sentence: It is produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and is distributed by Columbia Pictures.\nPage: Christmas Eve (2015 film). Sentence: The film features a large ensemble cast led by Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Jon Heder, Cheryl Hines, and Gary Cole.",
